{"ref":"BDB, בְּרִיעָה","hw":"בְּרִיעָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיעָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a son of Asher <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:17\" href=\"/Genesis.46.17\">Gn 46:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:44\" href=\"/Numbers.26.44\">Nu 26:44</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:45\" href=\"/Numbers.26.45\">45</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.30\">1 Ch 7:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.31\">31</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Ephraim <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.23\">1 Ch 7:23</a> (where expl. as if from <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרָעָה</span>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a Benjamite <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.13\">1 Ch 8:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.16\">1 Ch 8:16</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.10\">1 Ch 23:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.11\">11</a>.","next":"BDB, בְּרִיעִי","prev":"BDB, בֶּ֫רַע"}